Summon a Spider for [6, 7, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] turns to harass your foes. Spiders can poison your foes and throw webs to pin them to the ground.

It will get [55, 101, 142, 179, 215 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Dexterity, [12, 14, 16, 18, 20 (TL1-5)] Strength, 18 Willpower and 10 Constitution.

Your summons inherit some of your stats: increased damage%, resistance penetration %, stun/pin/confusion/blindness resistance, armour penetration.

Their Dexterity will increase with your Mindpower.
